# The working plan is tracked; everything else under .plans/ is not — .plans/memory/
# is a mirror of Claude's auto-memory and is personal notes, not project material.
# Written as `.plans/*` rather than `.plans/`, because git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is itself excluded.
